	file.0000000000000001.title: "&6Create: Evolution Age"
	quest.006FAC7AC897AF11.quest_desc: ["The &6Treated Wood Planks&r will be useful for many crafting projects soon."]
	quest.006FAC7AC897AF11.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.009488CD45CF167F.quest_desc: [
		"To ensure that only desired items are transported from the&6 hopper&r, apply a filter to the hopper by &bright-clicking&r on it while holding the item you want to pass through the &6hopper&r."
		""
		"There are more types of &6filters&r available."
	]
	quest.009488CD45CF167F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.00C7F07490E65A23.quest_desc: ["With this you can change the &btemperature&r of the enclosed space with &6oxygen&r."]
	quest.00C7F07490E65A23.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.03213ADB9CCB1552.title: "&6Early Storage"
	quest.035F046683D620A6.quest_desc: [
		"If you want to live on another &bplanet&r, this will help you."
		""
		"You'll need to supply &6oxygen&r from behind and &bkinetic&r energy from below. This will make the enclosed space you're in habitable without a &6spacesuit&r."
	]
	quest.035F046683D620A6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.039A67815FE85346.quest_desc: ["An improved lighter that is refilled with liquid fuel, which can be used to craft the &6Chemical Sprayer&r."]
	quest.039A67815FE85346.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.042BAB9ED025A0DC.quest_desc: ["A &6Blaze Burner&r is a heating component that is required for certain Mixing recipes. It can be used for &9heating&r &6Steam Engines, Bulk Smoking and Bulk Smelting&r"]
	quest.042BAB9ED025A0DC.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.04C54B1B5491791D.quest_desc: ["The &6Mechanical Plough&r will harvest all mature crops it comes in contact with while moving forward."]
	quest.04C54B1B5491791D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.050500B106B1B532.quest_desc: ["The &6Modular Diesel Engine&r is another variation of the Diesel Engine, however this version can connect to other &6Modular Diesel Engines&r arranged in a horizontal line with one another. The line of Modular Diesel Engines only requires one pipe input as the fuel will be shared among all connected engines. "]
	quest.050500B106B1B532.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0526F12A9C152997.quest_desc: ["When everything is ready, you press it and the &9countdown&r to takeoff will begin."]
	quest.0526F12A9C152997.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0526F12A9C152997.title: "&6Rocket Controls"
	quest.057CF3F72F23A931.quest_desc: ["To have a place to store the liquids"]
	quest.057CF3F72F23A931.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.066F8DB6A89C1CD9.quest_desc: ["The &6Precision Mechanism&r is one of many Crafting Components."]
	quest.066F8DB6A89C1CD9.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.06EBB50A95AB2148.quest_desc: [
		"The &bArc Furnace&r is the ultimate smelting. Processing multiple items simultaneously with incredible speed."
		""
		"Uses &6Graphite Electrodes&r that degrade over time and must be replaced. The &eelectrodes&r last approximately &980&r minutes of real time (about 4 in-game days of continuous operation)."
	]
	quest.06EBB50A95AB2148.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.06EBB50A95AB2148.title: "Arc Furnace"
	quest.0829ADDBB5BB1986.quest_desc: [
		"You can do it using the &9Create&r &bpressing&r or the &6IE&r"
		""
		"The &6IE&r pressing is better, but initially use the &9Create&r one"
	]
	quest.0829ADDBB5BB1986.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.085C342090F0686E.quest_desc: ["Give her a &6mixed salad&r to unlock inventory in her cheeks"]
	quest.085C342090F0686E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.085C342090F0686E.title: "&6Cheeks"
	quest.08744664DC1F966E.quest_desc: ["&6Train Signals&r are used to control the flow of Trains not driven by players."]
	quest.08744664DC1F966E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0891BBAA3DC7CC96.quest_desc: ["It's used to build the &bVirtual Machine&r"]
	quest.0891BBAA3DC7CC96.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0989187FE107410F.quest_desc: ["A &6List Filter&r or &6Attribute Filter&r can be used to create named categories including the items in the filters. This organizes the items in the &6Stock Keeper’s&r UI into named categories."]
	quest.0989187FE107410F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0A70574E08764282.quest_desc: ["You can speed up the &bBlast Furnace&r by adding &bBlast Furnace Preheaters&r to the sides. Each Preheater consumes 32 &9IF/t&r but significantly reduces smelting time."]
	quest.0A70574E08764282.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0A7095A70B438CA0.quest_desc: ["The best way to understand it is with &bponder&r"]
	quest.0A7095A70B438CA0.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0B533386BD3202C2.quest_desc: ["The &6Smart Observer&r is a machine that emits a redstone signal dependent on the block or items inside a container in front of it."]
	quest.0C4211C8DDC03401.quest_desc: ["The &6Item Batcher&r collects items until a specified quantity is reached"]
	quest.0C4211C8DDC03401.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0C7B8B0E22D8A5B7.quest_desc: ["Use on &6Diesel Engine&r to &bmake it faster&r"]
	quest.0C7B8B0E22D8A5B7.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0CE8FA0DDC38F33E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Deployer simulates&r player actions on blocks or entities exactly 2 blocks away from it. It can simulate a left or a right click, holding or without holding an item."
		""
		"It is used for several custom recipes in the &9modpack&r."
	]
	quest.0CE8FA0DDC38F33E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0DB064F13AFA6F46.quest_desc: ["Use on &6Diesel Engine&r to &bsilence&r it"]
	quest.0DB064F13AFA6F46.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0E15D76239571255.quest_desc: ["The &6Diesel Engine&r is a block that provides &bRotational Force(RPM&r) by providing it any liquid fuel like &6Diesel, Gasoline&r, etc. "]
	quest.0E15D76239571255.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.0FFDAD0A011B8438.quest_desc: ["An &6Elevator Pulley&r is a &bContraption&r useful for creating multi-floor elevators easily."]
	quest.0FFDAD0A011B8438.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.101069372B391BEE.quest_desc: ["The &6Hand Crank&r generates a small amount of Rotational Force through player interaction."]
	quest.101069372B391BEE.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.103D52BDC10F2163.quest_desc: ["A &6Display Link&r is used to get information from a block and send it to blocks that can display it."]
	quest.103D52BDC10F2163.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1064E419F244CF8C.quest_desc: ["&6Smart Chutes&r can transport up to 64 &9items&r in a stack."]
	quest.1064E419F244CF8C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.10D1E12867687058.quest_desc: ["The Spout is a block used for filling liquid containers such as bottles or buckets, or crafting with liquids."]
	quest.10D1E12867687058.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.10D7990F106BC026.quest_desc: [
		"To get &eelectricity&r for the &bIE&r in this modpack there are &62&r ways"
		""
		"You will need the &6first way&r before the second because of the materials in most cases."
	]
	quest.10D7990F106BC026.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.10D7990F106BC026.title: "&6Power Generation!"
	quest.1120ABC6DB93CE58.quest_desc: [
		"This mod is fully balanced."
		""
		"In this&b modpack&r, the &2terrain&r has been improved, and since there are more mountains, you can use this &6grappling hook&r to swing across."
		""
		"There are different types of &6grappling hooks&r with their own stats."
	]
	quest.1120ABC6DB93CE58.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.116CA174588C69CB.quest_subtitle: "Mix it with &6thorium and clay"
	quest.12A4DE292342EAC7.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.12AC9D785BCACA3E.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Crafting Terminal&r elevates "
		"your storage system by integrating crafting functionality"
		"directly into your &binventory interface&r."
	]
	quest.12AC9D785BCACA3E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.12AC9D785BCACA3E.title: "&6Crafting Terminal"
	quest.12E624BF66AF9D3B.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.12E624BF66AF9D3B.title: "Refinery"
	quest.139CE3EEE43E08F3.quest_desc: [
		"You can do it using the &9Create&r &bpressing&r or the &6IE&r"
		""
		"The &6IE&r pressing is better, but initially use the &9Create&r one"
	]
	quest.139CE3EEE43E08F3.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.13FC11C274F8867B.quest_desc: [
		"This is the &6heat&r source placed directly under the balloon's opening. It generates the &blift&r required to fly."
		""
		"Unlike standard burners, it does not require fuel"
	]
	quest.13FC11C274F8867B.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.148F0C61F366A962.quest_desc: [
		"This is where you can place the&6 target computers&r."
		""
		"The more &6target computers&r you have, the more &bfuel&r you'll save while traveling."
	]
	quest.148F0C61F366A962.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1549E7D4797E1A69.quest_desc: ["The &6Fluid Tank&r is a fluid storage mechanism that can store up to 8 buckets (displayed as 8,000 mB in-game) of fluid per block."]
	quest.1549E7D4797E1A69.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.160E3BFDE9DB8ACD.quest_desc: ["&6Fluid Pipes&r connect fluid containers and machines. "]
	quest.160E3BFDE9DB8ACD.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1821F09AD986B67A.quest_desc: ["It's obtained with &94&r &6Graphite Plates&r."]
	quest.1821F09AD986B67A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.183E273FCF0C4403.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have the &6Virtual Machine&r (the thing on the right that you can see), you'll need to place the terminal next to it."
		""
		"&9Right-clicking&r the interface will open; press the &9Enter&r key on the interface, click \"&bConnect&r,\" and press &9Enter&r again to access the dimension."
		""
		"To exit, press the '&9C&r' key."
	]
	quest.183E273FCF0C4403.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.18D43F3BF9DCC867.quest_desc: ["The &6Train Observer&r is used to detect passing Trains."]
	quest.18D43F3BF9DCC867.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1908198C99C88537.quest_subtitle: "Connect with a heat source into a boiler heater, spreads heat across all pipes evenly unless pumped."
	quest.190D59EDC8645BEA.quest_desc: [
		"A multiblock structure is a set of blocks that, when properly assembled, have a specific use."
		"For example, the &6Coke Oven&r."
		""
		"And if you don't know how to do it because you don't fully understand, look at the block's utilities by pressing the &9U key&r while you're hovering over an object and see the different sections."
	]
	quest.190D59EDC8645BEA.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.190D59EDC8645BEA.title: "&6What's a Multiblock?"
	quest.1A4980845BC72E7D.quest_desc: ["The &6Rope Pulley&r creates &bContraptions&r much like a &6Mechanical Piston&r, but in only one direction and without the need for &6Piston Extension Poles&r."]
	quest.1A4980845BC72E7D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1A5EF4ACB2E73F7A.quest_desc: ["Stops moving items when receiving a &4redstone signal&r."]
	quest.1A5EF4ACB2E73F7A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1A9A59FAE3117B8F.title: "&6Circuit Engraver"
	quest.1AEC0A7BAFD1973A.quest_desc: ["The &6attribute filter&r can allow items with any of the desired attributes, only allow them if they have all of the desired attributes"]
	quest.1AEC0A7BAFD1973A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1B044BF4B503D8B6.quest_desc: ["The &6Mechanical Mixer&r is a mechanical component that applies Mixing recipes and shapeless Crafting recipes to items in Basins."]
	quest.1B044BF4B503D8B6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1B402F125DA96C93.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1BB82F1B4A7C3949.quest_desc: [
		"Press &bR&r while hovering over an item to see its &9recipe&r."
		""
		"Press &bU&r while holding the cursor over an item to see what you can do with it"
		""
		"Press &bA&r while holding the cursor over an item in &dJEI&r to add it to favorites."
		""
		"Press &bM&r to open the Map"
		""
		"Press &bN&r to create a Waypoint"
		""
		"Press &bB&r to open the Backpack"
	]
	quest.1BB82F1B4A7C3949.quest_subtitle: "These keys are very useful, so keep them in mind."
	quest.1BB82F1B4A7C3949.title: "&6Controls"
	quest.1BC6AFBB468AC296.quest_desc: [
		"When placed in front of the &6Encased Fan&r this allows it to wash items."
		""
		"For example, soul sand into nether quartz."
	]
	quest.1BC6AFBB468AC296.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1C0B3F01A0497FE2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBlast Furnace&r smelts Iron into &6Steel&r using &6Coal Coke&r as fuel. Build it as a &93x3x3&r cube using &6Blast Bricks&r, similar to the Coke Oven."
		""
		"Each Iron Ingot plus one Coal Coke produces one &6Steel Ingot&r."
		""
		"The &bBlast Furnace&r also creates &6Slag&r as a byproduct, which can be used for building materials or fertilizer."
	]
	quest.1C0B3F01A0497FE2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1C0B3F01A0497FE2.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.1D1EAAB3DF7254C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Levitite&r is a block that has a lift power of &910 kpg&r (9 if you include its own weight)."
		""
		"However, it does not make blocks go up, but rather resists them of going up or down."
	]
	quest.1D1EAAB3DF7254C8.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1D527A8CFE166B27.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basin Lids&r allow you to process fluids and items into other fluids and items."
		""
		"And once you give it the required ingredients the &bBasin Processing Station&r will start processing them."
	]
	quest.1D527A8CFE166B27.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1DC60C8627790FFB.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1DDED493B197142E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Transfer Rate:&r 2,048 IF/t"
		""
		"&6Max Length:&r 16 blocks"
		""
		"&6Loss Per 16 Blocks:&r 1.25%"
	]
	quest.1DDED493B197142E.quest_subtitle: "LV (Low Voltage) [Click to more info]"
	quest.1DDED493B197142E.title: "&6Tier 1"
	quest.1E3A2775BE6B89DD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Gyroscopic Propeller Bearing&r is almost the same as the normal one, but tries to face up"
		""
		"Can be disabled using a &4redstone signal&r."
		""
		"Useful for &bhelicopters&r."
	]
	quest.1E3A2775BE6B89DD.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1EC2A97A7559B89D.quest_desc: ["While &6stationary&r, certain items can be applied to the block's filter. If it has a filter, it will only affect that &bcontraption&r actor."]
	quest.1EC2A97A7559B89D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1EF40C9CAEC07AC0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Electric Motor&r does almost the opposite of an &6Alternator&r."
		""
		"It transforms &eElectricity&r (&eFE&r) into &9Rotational Energy&r."
		""
		"You'll need to attach an &6IE connector&r to the &6Electric Motor&r and another to whatever you want to transfer the energy to, and then add a &6Wire Coil&r."
	]
	quest.1EF40C9CAEC07AC0.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1EF65D5C73CBC0BE.quest_desc: [
		"The &bAssembler&r automates crafting recipes. Supply materials to have the Assembler craft items automatically. It consumes &680 IF&r per crafting."
		""
		"Set up a chain where the first pattern crafts intermediate components that automatically flow to the next pattern for final assembly. Combine with &6conveyors&r and &6Item Routers&r or &9Network System&r of &bCreate &rfor fully automated production lines."
	]
	quest.1EF65D5C73CBC0BE.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1EF65D5C73CBC0BE.title: "Assembler"
	quest.1F167D31D31EB92D.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Airship Assembler&r is a crucial block for creating Simulated &9Contraptions&r. "
		""
		"When it's activated, all the connected blocks wil turn into a Contraption and have physics."
	]
	quest.1F167D31D31EB92D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1F6866B4E99B28CE.quest_desc: ["Use the &bQ&r inside the &9ponderer&r to see which blocks are."]
	quest.1F6866B4E99B28CE.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.1F6866B4E99B28CE.title: "&6Inspect"
	quest.218B4C8828423A7D.quest_desc: ["A block that allows imput and output of inventories 1 &9item&r at atime"]
	quest.218B4C8828423A7D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.21A30EA83D006834.quest_desc: ["You can do the grit in &6IE's&r &bcrusher&r"]
	quest.21A30EA83D006834.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.220A18F7D5B31851.quest_desc: [
		"You can choose between &9three types&r depending on your device."
		""
		"&6Low:&r Very well-optimized and attractive shaders"
		""
		"&6Standard:&r Very good and recommended"
		""
		"&6Ultra:&r Recommended only if you use &bDistant Horizons&r"
	]
	quest.220A18F7D5B31851.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.220A18F7D5B31851.title: "&eShaders"
	quest.22FE6DD555816964.title: "&6Tier 3&r HV Accumulator"
	quest.23354348E4456016.quest_desc: ["The basic element for creating everything related to &6fluid pipes&r."]
	quest.23354348E4456016.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2359AA964717C7F6.quest_desc: ["Use the &bCore Sample Drill&r to find mineral veins before building the &bExcavator&r."]
	quest.2359AA964717C7F6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.239AA59C76BB4A08.quest_desc: [
		"&6Transfer Rate:&r 8,192 IF/t"
		""
		"&6Max Length:&r 16 blocks"
		""
		"&6Loss Per 16 Blocks:&r 0.3%"
	]
	quest.239AA59C76BB4A08.quest_subtitle: "MV (Medium Voltage) [Click to more info]"
	quest.239AA59C76BB4A08.title: "&6Tier 2"
	quest.24770998614B215A.quest_desc: ["The &6Redstone Link&r is used to send and receive redstone signals to other links."]
	quest.25B661612D4F71AC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Package Frogports&r are used to move Cardboard Packages from and to Chain Conveyors."
		""
		"Right-click the chain of a &6Chain Conveyor&r to set the frogport’s target, then place the frogport. &6Frogports&r can be placed up to 4 blocks to the side and down from their target chain."
	]
	quest.25B661612D4F71AC.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.25F259ECFD3B0F5E.quest_desc: ["The &6Mechanical Drill&r is a block used to break blocks."]
	quest.25F259ECFD3B0F5E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.266137867D3C417E.quest_desc: ["If you mix thorium, clay, and stone&r in a &6mechanical mixer&r, the thorium will double."]
	quest.266137867D3C417E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2720A6C49CB4AAB7.quest_desc: ["Has a &6trapdoor&r that drops items into containers or machines below (into machine &6inputs&r)"]
	quest.2720A6C49CB4AAB7.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2759CD97096414AC.quest_desc: ["The &6Item Drain&r drains fluid from items such as buckets and bottles inserted onto it."]
	quest.2759CD97096414AC.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.275BBDC7E875035B.quest_desc: ["The &6Mechanical Arm&r can take or deposit items from various blocks within a 5 block radius of where it is placed."]
	quest.275BBDC7E875035B.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.281F9ED38AA62F4F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Hot Air Envelope&r (and the one with shaft) can be used to construct balloons. A balloon must be enclosed everywhere except at the bottom."
		""
		"When the balloon is big enough, it can be used to fly a Simulated &9Contraption&r."
	]
	quest.281F9ED38AA62F4F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.28B744BCCEC36B76.quest_desc: ["Sends a pulse after delaying for a specified time. You can configure the time."]
	quest.28FDA062B824F393.quest_desc: ["It is obtained by putting &6&6Graphite Dust&r&r with a &6Metal Press Mold Plate&r and &6Creosote Oil&r in a &bbottling machine&r."]
	quest.28FDA062B824F393.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.29395CF95EA69087.quest_desc: [
		"The &bExcavator&r mines mineral deposits from deep underground without physical digging."
		""
		"Requires a &6Bucket Wheel&r attached to a main body."
		""
		"The Excavator consumes &64096 IF/t&r while operating and extracts ores from mineral veins. "
	]
	quest.29395CF95EA69087.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.29395CF95EA69087.title: "Excavator"
	quest.2A762CD0C7934E49.quest_subtitle: "A 10% chance of getting"
	quest.2A7A2F9C7AAD5498.quest_desc: ["It is used to store &eenergy&r (FE). You can input energy via an &6IE connector&r connected by a &6Wire&r to a power source (FE)."]
	quest.2A7A2F9C7AAD5498.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2A7A2F9C7AAD5498.title: "&6Tier&r 1 LV Accumulator"
	quest.2AD5C671AB8D28C8.quest_desc: ["An important &6ingredient&r for most things in this &bmod&r."]
	quest.2AD5C671AB8D28C8.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2AD5C671AB8D28C8.title: "&6Circuit"
	quest.2BEE938A2363263D.quest_desc: ["Once the &bLayers&r are built one on top of the other, &9R-clicking&r will create the &6virtual machine&r."]
	quest.2BEE938A2363263D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2BEEB99A8979BB27.quest_desc: [
		"You can &aeasily&r see it going to the &6Cart Assembler&r and contraption controls &bponder&r"
		""
		"&6Contraptions&r are created when a &bMovement Anchor&r is activated and the attached blocks are assembled into a Contraption. Most Movement Anchors will activate when given &bRotational Force(RPM)&r and disassemble back into blocks when not receiving power or when the Contraption is unable to move. Others are activated manually or by &6Redstone&r."
	]
	quest.2BF9E5CAC8B32953.quest_desc: [
		"When placed in front of the Encased Fan this allows it to haunt items."
		"For example, sand into soul sand."
	]
	quest.2BF9E5CAC8B32953.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2C2BCC1351C3506E.quest_desc: ["When a &6Stock Link&r is placed on a &6Packager&r, the Packager can receive requests from a &9Logistics Network&r. It can create packages with an address, specific items, and a specific amount of items."]
	quest.2C2BCC1351C3506E.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2C852E4F842F1B23.quest_desc: ["&6Glue&r together the blocks you want to have &bphysics&r, then put the &6physics assembler&r on top of those blocks and activate the lever"]
	quest.2C852E4F842F1B23.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2D0A735800782EB2.quest_desc: [
		"Gears are basic components used to transmit rotation. While small gears are standard, large gears can transmit power around curves and are necessary for the operation of rotation speed controllers."
		""
		"&9How they connect:&r"
		"&6Side by side:&r They transfer rotation at the same speed, but in opposite directions."
		""
		"&6Perpendicular (90°)&r: By using two large gears, the axis of rotation is changed while maintaining the same speed."
		""
		"&6Diagonal:&r By connecting a small gear to a large gear, the speed is changed (making the smaller gear rotate faster)."
		""
		"&6Shaft function:&r They transmit power from their center like a shaft. This function can be locked by installing a housing with a key."
	]
	quest.2D0A735800782EB2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2E34A89E0DDB7FAD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Mechanical Press&r is a mechanical component that applies Pressing, Packing, and Compacting recipes to items below it. "
		""
		"Is important to press Ingots into Sheets, which are important ingredients for higher-level components."
	]
	quest.2E34A89E0DDB7FAD.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2E72EEB7CB9906AD.quest_desc: ["Thrust can move &bsimulated contraptions&r. Reversing the rotation reverses the thrust, can be also reversed using a &6wrench&r."]
	quest.2E72EEB7CB9906AD.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2EC27DD58CBF8FD2.quest_desc: [
		""
		""
		"You're ready to &abegin.&r"
		""
		"The ultimate &6goal&r in this modpack is to reach &dspace&r."
		""
		"To view the &6quests&r, move your cursor to the left."
		""
		"If you'd like, you can join the &9Discord&r server to give suggestions, receive updates, and much more!"
	]
	quest.2EC27DD58CBF8FD2.quest_subtitle: "Read the description!"
	quest.2EC27DD58CBF8FD2.title: "&aThe beginning!"
	quest.2FA61A2BA5EC0D10.quest_desc: ["A &6Mechanical Belt&r must be placed between two shafts. The shafts must be horizontal, parallel to each other, and perpendicular to the belt itself, and they must be aligned horizontally, vertically, or diagonally."]
	quest.2FA61A2BA5EC0D10.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.2FDEE91F1706C83A.quest_desc: [
		"Connect both of these directly to a &6rod&r"
		"(the inserter only works in a straight line)"
		"{image:kubejs:block/preview_nuclear_energy width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
		"{image:kubejs:block/second_preview_nuclear_energy width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.2FDEE91F1706C83A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to view IMAGES!]"
	quest.3004D373CBC4B0A5.quest_desc: ["Pulls items out of adjacent inventories automatically. Place next to&6 chests&r, &6machines&r, or the &9output side&r of &bmultiblock&rs to extract processed items."]
	quest.3004D373CBC4B0A5.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.300AC1AE6EB00083.quest_desc: ["The &brocket&r's &6walls&r will have to be made of this material to withstand the extreme &bheat&r and &bcold&r of space."]
	quest.300AC1AE6EB00083.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.300AC1AE6EB00083.title: "&6Titanium Plating"
	quest.301901CCD958A2FA.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSqueezer&r extracts &6Plant Oil&r from seeds and Hemp Seeds."
		""
		"This &6oil&r is one component of Biodiesel fuel"
	]
	quest.301901CCD958A2FA.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.301901CCD958A2FA.title: "Industrial Squeezer"
	quest.3035ED7671903344.quest_desc: [
		"&9What it does:&r Provides a compact, portable source of &ekinetic energy&r for vehicles."
		""
		"&9How it does it:&r It consumes standard furnace fuel to generate a constant output of 1024 &6SU&r at 32 &bRPM&r. It is highly efficient for small craft, running for up to 1.5 hours on a single stack of coal."
		""
		"The &6diesel engine&r can also be used with its fuel, which is oil."
	]
	quest.3035ED7671903344.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.314A29D202BC109C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.314A29D202BC109C.title: "&6Things for classification and organization"
	quest.31D73D839DDCECFE.quest_subtitle: "We have entered the &6nuclear age!"
	quest.3343192523EEA230.quest_desc: ["The &6mechanical bearing&r is used to rotate blocks above it."]
	quest.3343192523EEA230.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.334E2025B40EE10D.quest_desc: [
		"Tasks with &6orange&r letters = The &9minimum&r for the first &bRocket&r"
		""
		"This will &bguide&r you through the process of your first journey, which is to the &bmoon&r."
		""
		"The rocket must be &bglued&r together as a contraption, otherwise it won't work."
		"Once you're seated in the rocket, you can press &3F5&r to get an external view of the &brocket&r."
		""
		"Before landing on the &bplanet&r, you must &3right-click&r on the &6Rocket Controls&r to control the rocket. This will allow you to land more slowly by &3holding&r the &3space bar&r; otherwise, you'll see the consequences."
		""
		"-&zMinimum&r requirements for the rocket to go to the &bmoon&r:"
		""
		"  ·A &92x9&r &6fluid tank&r"
		"  ·&917&r &6rocket engines&r"
		"  ·&6Titanium Space Door&r for entry"
		"  ·&6Rocket controller&r"
		"  ·&6Rocket station&r"
		"  ·&6Seat&r"
		"  ·And a &6spacesuit&r"
	]
	quest.334E2025B40EE10D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.334E2025B40EE10D.title: "&bThe Space"
	quest.33BA256B6190C0E2.quest_desc: [
		"Create a &92×2&r pool of water source blocks, place the &bFluid Pump&r one block above, and apply a&4 redstone torch&r."
		""
		"This provides unlimited water for &bGarden Cloches&r and other &bmachines&r without depleting your water supply."
	]
	quest.33BA256B6190C0E2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.33BA256B6190C0E2.title: "&6Infinite Water Source"
	quest.33C330BB340B448C.quest_desc: ["The &6Adjustable Chain Gearshift&r functions similarly to &6Encased Chain Drive&r, but can change the speed of the output when powered with redstone."]
	quest.33C330BB340B448C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.34213CDC95210D11.quest_desc: ["It can be placed in the &6computer rack&r."]
	quest.34213CDC95210D11.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3462A42B7F89739A.quest_desc: [
		"You can do it using the &9Create&r &bpressing&r or the &6IE&r"
		""
		"The &6IE&r pressing is better, but initially use the &9Create&r one"
	]
	quest.3462A42B7F89739A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.34A37F3D682071B8.quest_subtitle: "It replaces the &6burner"
	quest.360563867FB88329.quest_desc: ["The &6Rotation Speed Controller&r is a mechanical component that allows the player to precisely control &brotational speed(RPM)&r."]
	quest.360563867FB88329.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.361B93583A8552C6.quest_desc: ["&6Train Tracks&r are special blocks used to support Trains."]
	quest.361B93583A8552C6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3784F0CEFE401826.quest_desc: ["&6Redstone Contacts&r allow &6Contraptions&r to convey redstone signals or activate Redstone Circuits."]
	quest.37E3C525820A4F71.quest_desc: ["To achieve this, you need to place an &6empty bucket&r in the &bcoke oven&r, and when the creosote oil reaches 1000&9 mB&r, the bucket will fill itself."]
	quest.37E3C525820A4F71.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.38462EEB096040B6.quest_desc: ["The &6Weighted Ejector&r flings items and entities to a targeted block up to 32 blocks away."]
	quest.38462EEB096040B6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.38874C2107279987.quest_desc: [
		"The &6telescope&r is used to plot the route to any &bplanet&r you want to visit."
		""
		"If you want to go to the &bMoon&r, you'll need to make three &6papers&r with different distances."
	]
	quest.38874C2107279987.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.38874C2107279987.title: "&6Telescope"
	quest.38DA40A510A9E954.quest_desc: [
		"&6Chutes&r transport items vertically, generally downward unless an &6encased fan&r is used to blow items upward."
		""
		"&6Chutes&r are limited to no more than 16 &9items&r in a stack."
	]
	quest.38DA40A510A9E954.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.38DC066AEE6F9AF5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Engineer's Goggles&r are a wearable item that allow the user to see more details about placed machines."
		"Like &6SU&r and &bRPM&r"
	]
	quest.38DC066AEE6F9AF5.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3950655778F0852C.quest_desc: ["The &6Threshold Switch&r measures how full an inventory is and can emit a Redstone signal at adjustable thresholds."]
	quest.398C855835935EDE.quest_desc: [
		"&6List filters&r are used to adjust the number of items processed at a time."
		""
		"There are several types, which you can explore on your own."
	]
	quest.398C855835935EDE.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.39ED5B98041C01F5.quest_desc: [
		"It transforms &9Rotational Energy&r into &eElectricity&r (&eFE&r)."
		""
		"You'll need to attach an &6IE connector&r to the &6Alternator&r and another to whatever you want to transfer the energy to, and then add a &6Wire Coil&r."
	]
	quest.39ED5B98041C01F5.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3A090E1EB11B91EC.quest_desc: [
		"These are the blocks used to build the actual &bballoon structure&r."
		""
		"For the balloon to function, the &6envelope&r must be fully enclosed on all sides except for a single opening at the bottom."
	]
	quest.3A090E1EB11B91EC.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3AAF8F3B14525CA4.quest_desc: ["The &9Gantry Carriage&r is a block that can move &bContraptions&r along &6Gantry Shafts&r."]
	quest.3AAF8F3B14525CA4.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3CE4A33B7A4BAE3D.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Thermoelectric Generator&r produces &epower&r from temperature differences between blocks on opposite sides. Place &4hot&r blocks like Lava or Magma Blocks on one side and &bcold&r blocks like Ice or Packed Ice on the other. The greater the temperature difference, the more power generated."
		""
		"The &6Engineer's Manual&r lists the blocks you can use and their temperatures."
		""
		"&eEnergy&r is transmitted through &6wire coils&r and &6connectors&r"
	]
	quest.3CE4A33B7A4BAE3D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3D3C0A08DCB6E755.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3E93F5CF1FC0DE4A.quest_desc: ["The &bIndustrial Fermenter&r speeds up growth significantly but is not required."]
	quest.3E93F5CF1FC0DE4A.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3E93F5CF1FC0DE4A.title: "Industrial Fermenter"
	quest.3EB73CC0B7F66B43.quest_desc: ["Necessary to build the &6Virtual Machine&r that you can see below on the right."]
	quest.3EB73CC0B7F66B43.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3EC983DC7998279C.quest_desc: [
		"The following missions will tell you what they are."
		""
		"&6Stress&r is a term used to describe the kinetic form of power used in Create, measured in &6Stress Units (SU)&r."
		""
		"Machines drain stress from a network, working faster and using an amount of stress that is directly proportional to the angular velocity (measured in RPM) of their input. The amount of stress available (Stress Capacity) can be increased by adding Water Wheels, Windmills, or other Generators to the network."
		""
		"&6Speed&r refers to how quickly a rotational component is spinning; it is measured in &6Revolutions Per Minute (RPM)&r and can be seen with a &9Speedometer&r. The maximum rotation speed of a component is 256 RPM by default (Configurable). Any component added to step up speed further, such as a cogwheel on a large cogwheel, will break off."
	]
	quest.3EC983DC7998279C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.3EC983DC7998279C.title: "&6How to create \"SU\" and \"RPM\""
	quest.3EEA0C9E96C924E2.quest_desc: ["&6Train Stations&r are used to create, disassemble, and guide Trains."]
	quest.3EEA0C9E96C924E2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.4000E7F3A1CBEBD5.quest_desc: ["I added a bunch of custom &brecipes&r in this mod"]
	quest.4000E7F3A1CBEBD5.quest_subtitle: "Beggining of the Industry"
	quest.4000E7F3A1CBEBD5.title: "&6Getting started with IE!"
	quest.407CABB8311D8E97.quest_subtitle: "Direct the heat to the area where it is, but don't overheat it."
	quest.42166A5ADC3BA8CD.title: "&6Polished Amethyst"
	quest.427496266ECBADBA.quest_desc: ["It's a &6piston&r that you can extend. In order to extend, the piston must have &6Piston Extension Pole&r at the end."]
	quest.427496266ECBADBA.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.427A9FFF1052641D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Millstone&r can be powered by a &6Shaft&r from below or by a &6Cogwheel&r from the side."
		""
		"It is used to crush items and obtain items derived from it."
	]
	quest.427A9FFF1052641D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.42AF6B83E218A56E.quest_desc: ["The &6lever&r emits a redstone signal with an adjustable strength. Right click to make it higher, shift right click to make it lower. The current signal strength can be viewed by looking at the lever while wearing &6Engineer's Goggles&r."]
	quest.42BA68234931622F.quest_desc: ["You can do the grit in &6IE's&r &bcrusher&r"]
	quest.42BA68234931622F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.43651629CF6EE807.quest_desc: ["This will make the &blanding&r automatic."]
	quest.43651629CF6EE807.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.43C94F3B11F92DC0.quest_desc: ["The &6Shaft&r is a basic mechanical component in Create. A shaft can be used to connect two mechanical components such that the rotation of one rotates the other, and shafts serve as the only blocks upon which &6Mechanical Belts&r can be placed."]
	quest.43C94F3B11F92DC0.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.4408CEE848788C75.quest_desc: ["You can do the grit in &6IE's&r &bcrusher&r"]
	quest.4408CEE848788C75.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.44745FFE209CA677.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Pipes&r are blocks used to transport and deal with fluids."
		""
		"&6Mechanical Pumps&r have a maximum range of 16 blocks and will move fluid in only one direction at a time."
	]
	quest.44745FFE209CA677.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.447BAF652BDD7A7F.quest_desc: ["The &6Hose Pulley&r lets down a hose that can drain bodies of liquids."]
	quest.447BAF652BDD7A7F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.4488AD145876B27C.quest_desc: ["As proof, give a &6Moon Stone&r."]
	quest.4488AD145876B27C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.44A516DB9D718680.quest_desc: [
		"With &6sandpaper&r you can &bpolish&r objects that will be very useful."
		""
		"To &bpolish&r something, you'll need to have the &6sandpaper&r in the &9offhand&r and the object you want to polish in the other."
	]
	quest.44A516DB9D718680.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.44A516DB9D718680.title: "&6Sand Paper"
	quest.44D6D8FF697CD5D6.quest_desc: ["The &6Huge Diesel Engine&r is a similar block to the &6Diesel Engine&r but it functions more closely to the Steam Engine. Connecting a &6Shaft&r to the long arm of the &6Huge Diesel Engine&r creates a rotational output. The direction output can be adjusted through the Value Settings on the sides of the engine. "]
	quest.44D6D8FF697CD5D6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.455FCB0C6B1C65F2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Nixie Tube&r is a block that can display text or numbers."
		""
		"When right clicked with a named Name Tag or a Clipboard with text, the &6Nixie Tube&r as well as adjacent Nixie Tubes will display the text."
	]
	quest.455FCB0C6B1C65F2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.458A376BC3E52E5D.quest_desc: ["The&6 Mechanical Harvester&r will harvest all mature crops it comes in contact with while moving forward."]
	quest.458A376BC3E52E5D.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.45C5BDDA27FCF892.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Stock Keeper&r can see all the items on the network. The UI displays how many Stock Links are connected. If the Stock Keeper is left unlocked, players can search the network, request items, and give their requests an Address to be sent to."
		""
		"Click a &6Stock Link&r with the Stock Ticker to connect it to that network."
	]
	quest.45C5BDDA27FCF892.quest_subtitle: "A Stock Ticker is used to request items from a Logistics Network."
	quest.46BC8F3A35EAF692.quest_desc: [
		"&6Linear Chassis:&r"
		"Will automatically connect to adjacent and equally aligned chassis."
		""
		""
		"&6Radial Chassis:&r"
		"Unlike Linear Chassis, the Radial Chassis connects to a radius of blocks around it rather than a straight line of blocks."
	]
	quest.46BC8F3A35EAF692.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.46F0E92662234196.quest_desc: ["If you combine it with &6bamboo&r, you create the &6polymer blend&r."]
	quest.46F0E92662234196.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.478015FD9FBDB844.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Wrench&r is a tool used to rotate, dismantle and configure components"
		""
		"Using a Wrench on a component will rotate the component around the face with which you interacted."
		""
		"Using a Wrench on a component, redstone component, rail or vanilla rail variant will dismantle it and place it in your inventory. Any block which can be rotated or otherwise interacted with using right click must be dismantled while sneaking."
	]
	quest.478015FD9FBDB844.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.47EE615380C3CA82.quest_desc: ["You can put &6rice&r in its cheeks and when it runs out of hearts it will eat it to passively &eregenerate&r them."]
	quest.47EE615380C3CA82.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.47EE615380C3CA82.title: "&6Regeneration"
	quest.480E1FF6083548A2.quest_desc: [
		"You can see how to build a &9Multiblock&r in this &6book&r."
		""
		"You have to go to &bMultiblock Constructions&r or &bHeavy Machines&r, and when you choose the one you want to build, it will show you how to do it step by step."
	]
	quest.480E1FF6083548A2.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.480E1FF6083548A2.title: "Engineer's manual"
	quest.48C106E0AFBB18D3.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Depot&r is used as an interaction point for machines such as the &6Mechanical Arm.&r"
		""
		"Machines such as &6Mechanical Presses&r will interact with the items the same way they would on a &6Mechanical Belt&r."
	]
	quest.48C106E0AFBB18D3.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.49D336BC7559DF3C.quest_desc: ["The best way to understand it is with &bponder&r"]
