	quest.4FCF693691246668.quest_desc: ["&6Mechanical Saws&r automatically chop down wood blocks in front of them. When chopping down a tree or giant mushroom, it will automatically destroy the entire tree by only destroying the bottom-most block"]
	quest.4FCF693691246668.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.4FE821472434CD0E.quest_desc: ["An upgrade to the &6andesite tunnel&r allowing more configurability in how to deal with items."]
