	quest.5B421D92A1D95A3C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5B421D92A1D95A3C.title: "Metal Press"
	quest.5BA27D4900BF81FC.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Storage Terminal&r serves as your primary &binterface&r for accessing stored items."
		""
		"Once you’ve crafted your Storage Terminal, place it adjacent to any storage block:"
		"As a &6chest&r, &6item vault from Create&r..."
	]
	quest.5BA27D4900BF81FC.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5BA27D4900BF81FC.title: "&6Storage Terminal"
	quest.5BD1E47DE9A0802F.quest_subtitle: "It's an improvement to the &6basic solar heating panel&r"
	quest.5CC12C0CD4BF59AA.quest_subtitle: "It's basically a solar panel"
	quest.5D214AF286BE65F6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Super glue&r has two modes of application: Block by Block Mode and Area Mode. These modes can be intermixed on the same contraption."
		""
		"&9Block by Block:&r"
		"Is used just like a Slimeball. Right clicking on a Linear Chassis or Radial Chassis while holding the super glue, coats the face of a chassis with green glue allowing other blocks to be attached."
		""
		"&9Area Mode:&r"
		"Area mode is used to glue sets of blocks. To glue a 3D section of blocks, right-click on a block in one corner of the section while holding down the glue button. Move the cursor to the opposite corner of the section. A green box will appear indicating the blocks to be glued. Right-click again to complete the gluing process. To cancel the process, right-click while crouching."
	]
	quest.5D214AF286BE65F6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5D2FFD5755BC08B6.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.5D2FFD5755BC08B6.quest_subtitle: "You will need one of these to put the fuel into the inserter"
	quest.5D30FB5F11F0F73B.quest_desc: ["The &6Sequenced Gearshift&r allows finer control over &bRotational power(RPM)&r, allowing multiple changes to the rotation over a period of time."]
	quest.5D30FB5F11F0F73B.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5D93F01505FF5673.quest_subtitle: "To tame it, you must give it &6cabbage leaves while you are crouching"
	quest.5DCFDF6B2D07452C.quest_desc: [
		"You have to &bRight-Click&r on the hamster and then place the link to it. The hamster will now be able to sleep in its bed."
		""
		"If you wish, it can walk 16&9 blocks&r away from its bed."
	]
	quest.5DCFDF6B2D07452C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5DF797E439E1E90F.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Coke Oven&r is your first multiblock structure, built as a &b3x3x3&r cube using Coke Bricks. Right-click the center block of any face with your &6Engineer’s Hammer&r to form the multiblock. "
		""
		"Insert Coal to produce &6Coal Coke&r and &6Creosote Oil&r, which is a slow process, taking up to 5 minutes each time."
	]
	quest.5DF797E439E1E90F.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5DF797E439E1E90F.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.5DFDB6E18CCE4927.quest_desc: ["The &6Encased Fan&r is a mechanical component that can create air streams. Encased Fans are used for moving entities, vertical transport of items, Bulk Washing, Bulk Blasting, Bulk Haunting, and Bulk Smoking."]
	quest.5DFDB6E18CCE4927.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.5E5A6ACE96555226.quest_desc: [
		"When placed adjacent to any inventory, &6Packagers&r can create &6Cardboard Packages&r from the inventory they’re attached to."
		""
		"When a &6Stock Link&r is placed on a &6Packager&r, the Packager can receive requests from a &9Logistics Network&r. It can create packages with an address, specific items, and a specific amount of items."
	]
