	quest.64C6695EC2DE414C.quest_desc: [
		"By default, each &9Item Vault&r block has a storage space of 20 stacks."
		""
		"Items cannot be added or removed by the player, but by components such as &6Chutes, Funnels, and Item Hatches&r."
		""
		"&9Item Vaults&r will connect with other Item Vaults"
		""
		"A &6Redstone Comparator&r can be used to show the Vault's inventory, outputting a signal strength of 15 when the Vault is full. A Display Link can also be used on a &6Smart Observer&r or &6Threshold Switch&r facing the Vault to display its inventory."
	]
	quest.64C6695EC2DE414C.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
