	quest.6DBDFE7FCD2D28B6.quest_desc: [
		"Depending on the &btemperature&r, the ingredient can change state. The ingredient is inserted via pipe."
		""
		"&9Example:&r"
		"If &6Liquid Oxygen&r is hotter than &9-&r185&9°C&r, it will transform into &6Oxygen Gas&r."
		""
		"If &6Oxygen Gas&r is colder than &9-&r185&9°C&r, it will transform into &6Liquid Oxygen&r."
		""
		"And this also applies to other things."
	]
	quest.6DBDFE7FCD2D28B6.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.6E180D3A66985DA9.quest_desc: ["&6Inventory Cables&r allow you to connect remote storage areas to your main &6terminal&r."]
	quest.6E180D3A66985DA9.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.6E9BE0171646A432.quest_desc: ["The &6Portable Fluid Interface&r is the fluid version of the Portable Storage Interface. It is used to insert or extract from the fluid inventory of a Contraption."]
	quest.6E9BE0171646A432.quest_subtitle: "[Click to read]"
	quest.6F519A37EDC43E66.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Fluid Pump&r actively moves fluids when powered by &4redstone&r."
