	quest.702E3F0B8F5DAB51.quest_desc: [
		"&9Create Evolution Age&r is based on the Create mod. It features &#FFD203electricity&r, &2nuclear power&r, and even the ability to \"&#FF9812create your own electronic circuits&r\" with the Power Grind mod!"
		""
		"The Ponder function is an in-game guide system that allows the player to quickly obtain information about crafting blocks."
		""
		"The Ponder screen displays an example mechanism that explains the block's functions. You can activate it by hovering over the crafting item and holding down &6W&r."
