	quest.7D59325F98131299.quest_desc: [
		"A easy to use &6trowel&r to &zrandomize&r which blocks to place, but with many advance options if you want it."
		""
		""
		"It's got 3 modes you can switch between with &bR&r:"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6Quick&r - Just places random blocks from your hotbar (like other trowel/shuffle mods)"
		"&6Palette&r - Uses custom palettes you make with percentage for each block"
		"&6Wand&r - Places multiple connected blocks at once (needs an upgrade item or change config)"
	]
